<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Razor">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
		<ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<AddRazorSupportForMvc>true</AddRazorSupportForMvc>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<Version>0.16.0</Version>
		<Authors>Codeer</Authors>
		<Company>Codeer</Company>
		<Description>Extra field components and client-side services for Codeer.LowCode.Blazor. Includes Calendar, Gantt Chart, Task Board (Kanban), Rich Text Editor, Markdown Editor, Color Picker, Marker List, QR Code, Progress Bar, Password Hash, and AI Text Analyzer fields, plus built-in script objects (Excel, WebApi, Toaster, Mail) and client infrastructure services (HTTP, UI, logging, localization).</Description>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Codeer-Software/Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras</PackageProjectUrl>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Codeer-Software/Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras</RepositoryUrl>
		<RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
		<PackageTags>Blazor;LowCode;Codeer;Calendar;Gantt;Kanban;TaskBoard;RichText;Markdown;ColorPicker;QRCode;Progress;PasswordHash</PackageTags>
		<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
		<PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>New: EditHistoryField and EditHistoryContractField (edit history). Put EditHistoryField on a module and every save of a record of that module (create, update, delete) is recorded in a history module as a snapshot of the whole record including its owned records (detail rows, Gantt tasks and the like) (the recording is done by EditHistoryRecorder in Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server 0.15.0, wired in the app templates). On the detail page the field lists the versions (number, change type, user, date and only the changed fields as old -&gt; new; list rows as added / removed / changed), shows a past version in a view-only dialog with the changed fields highlighted, and restores a version by applying it to the form: the user saves to confirm, so permissions, validation, optimistic locking and the history of the restore itself all go through the normal save. The history module declares its field names with EditHistoryContractField (roles ModuleName / DataId / ChangeType / Snapshot required, UserId / DateTime optional; design checks for missing fields, wrong types and duplicates; the roles follow renames). EditHistoryChangeType (Add / Update / Delete) is a design enum. History is read through the normal module data API, so who can see it is the read permission of the history module. Version numbers are not stored but numbered from the count at display time. Not covered: restoring a deleted record from the history list, restoring attached files (only name and key are recorded). Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.35. Also new: EditHistoryRestoreButtonField, placed on the history module, restores a deleted record: for a module with logical delete the record and its owned records come back with their Ids (links keep working; recorded as a Restore version), for a module with physical delete a new record is created from the snapshot. Restoring a version also revives logically deleted list rows with their Ids (the undelete is sent with the save and confirmed in the same transaction). The version list shows only "record created" for a create, collapses list rows behind their summary, and shows just "changed" for field types that cannot be rendered as text. Edit history cannot be combined with the delete archive (design check). Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.37. The records of a version are the record itself plus the owned records declared with IOwnedRecordsFieldDesign of Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.37 (a list declares its rows when they belong to the record; GanttFieldDesign, CalendarFieldDesign, TaskBoardFieldDesign and MarkerListFieldDesign now declare their child records, so they are recorded without an extra list). A field that implements the new IOwnedRecordsField (GanttField, CalendarField, TaskBoardField and MarkerListField do) also takes part in "restore this version".</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<PackageId>Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras</PackageId>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<PropertyGroup>
		<StaticWebAssetFingerprintingEnabled>false</StaticWebAssetFingerprintingEnabled>
		<StaticWebAssetsFingerprintContent>false</StaticWebAssetsFingerprintContent>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<!-- internal はファミリー内(Server/Designer)とテストにだけ見せる (ファミリー外の製品アセンブリへのIVTは不可) -->
		<AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
			<_Parameter1>Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server</_Parameter1>
		</AssemblyAttribute>
		<AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
			<_Parameter1>Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Designer</_Parameter1>
		</AssemblyAttribute>
		<AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
			<_Parameter1>Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Test</_Parameter1>
		</AssemblyAttribute>
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Codeer.LowCode.Blazor" Version="1.3.37" />
		<PackageReference Include="Markdig" Version="0.37.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="QRCoder" Version="1.7.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.WebUtilities" Version="8.0.8" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly" Version="8.0.8" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Http" Version="8.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Excel.Report.PDF" Version="0.36.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Sotsera.Blazor.Toaster" Version="3.0.0" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<EmbeddedResource Update="Properties\Resources.resx">
			<Generator>ResXFileCodeGenerator</Generator>
			<LastGenOutput>Resources.Designer.cs</LastGenOutput>
		</EmbeddedResource>
		<EmbeddedResource Update="Properties\Resources.ja-JP.resx">
			<Generator>ResXFileCodeGenerator</Generator>
			<LastGenOutput>Resources.ja-JP.Designer.cs</LastGenOutput>
		</EmbeddedResource>
		<Compile Update="Properties\Resources.Designer.cs">
			<DesignTime>True</DesignTime>
			<AutoGen>True</AutoGen>
			<DependentUpon>Resources.resx</DependentUpon>
		</Compile>
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
